      "location": {
        "known": true,
        "value": "Caelid : 1 northeast of the Smoldering Wall site of grace, next to the Giant Crow . [ Map link ] 15 around the Church of the Plague : 7 inside, and 8 in the graveyard outside. 2 northwest of the Southern Aeonia Swamp Bank site of grace, on a corpse sitting in a chair.; Altus Plateau : 1 far to the south of the Bower of Bounty site of grace. 1 on a high cliff to the north of the lake, overlooking Sage's Cave, behind an eagle sitting on the cliff 4 near Wyndham Ruins , east of Wyndham Catacombs entrance. 11 around Writheblood Ruins : 9 inside the ruins, and 2 southeast. 10 near the Amber Starlight .; Mt. Gelmir : 1 close to the Nomadic Merchant , but on a different cliff. From the Ninth Mt. Gelmir Campsite site of grace: go across the rope bridge, then down the ladder to the northeast, then south. [ Map link ] 3 near the Abductor Virgins after Bridge of Iniquity Site of Grace , close to the cliff overlooking The Shaded Castle . 4 on a cliff below the Nomadic Merchant . From the merchant: climb down the long ladder to the east, then go southwest. 4 east of the Corpse-Stench Shack , sprouting from small mounds of corpses [ Elden Ring Map link ] 6 near the Hermit Village : 2 southwest and 4 on a cliff northeast. [ Map Link 1] [ Map Link 2] 3 near the base of the watchtower, west of the First Mt. Gelmir Campsite site of grace. 4 can be gathered on the cliffs behind Fort Laiedd in Mt. Gelmir [ Elden Ring Map Link ] 3 can be gathered in Mt. Gelmir , guarded by two foot soldiers [ Elden Ring Map Link ] 4 can be gathered north of Mt. Gelmir , in an area west of the Minor Erdtree (Mt. Gelmir) surrounded by bow wielding Marionette Soldiers [ Elden Ring Map Link ]",
